{
 "name": "hwfit4-s",
 "notes": "The reference face for this screen, cool colouring. A deep blue ground lit from the middle, a frame of sixty dots with the quarters written in and a tablet carrying the second round it. The weekday above, the day and the month on one line, the hour and the minute tall in the middle; every number is set in a rounded condensed face, the words in the condensed sans. On every tenth second the tablet strikes: it swells, glows and takes the red of the heart; on the next it is still a little large. Weather and steps below in large type, heart and charge under them. Every picture is drawn by make_case.py.",
